config BR2_PACKAGE_TDVP_K230_IOMUX
	bool "tdvp-k230-iomux"
	help
	  Install a small K230 IOMUX validation helper.

	  This is a bring-up tool, not an application API.  It is used to
	  mirror the LilyGO demo pinmux sequence until the K230 IOMUX path is
	  represented cleanly by kernel pinctrl and device tree.
